/* ----------------------------------------------------------------
 * cq_lookup() 
 * cq_lookup() defines a hash cookie for every cql() declaration.  The
 * cookie associates the caql string with a "base query" function
 * [caql_basic_fn_#()] that constructs the scan for the query.  
